{
    "title": "Flipp: Shop Grocery Deals",
    "description": "Why have several store apps taking up space when Flipp can find you deals from them all? Flipp is the most powerful app for grocery savings and coupons. Simplify your grocery shopping routine and save money on your final bill. Create your grocery list and plan ahead with weekly ads and grocery coupons from thousands of stores \u2014 all in one place!\r\n\r\nSaving money while grocery shopping just got a whole lot easier when you can compare food prices from:\r\n- Walmart\r\n- Target\r\n- Albertsons\r\n- Safeway\r\n- Publix\r\n\r\nBeyond groceries, Flipp has pharmacy coupons from stores like Walgreens and CVS. And if you love Publix and Family Dollar coupons, you\u2019re in luck because Flipp has them too! \r\n\r\nThere\u2019s something for everyone on Flipp \u2014 from tech lovers to pet parents. Find deals from specialty stores including:\r\n- Best Buy\r\n- Home Depot\r\n- Lowes\r\n- Petco\r\n- Petsmart\r\n\r\nWe\u2019re always adding new stores to make saving money on shopping simple!\r\n\r\nReady to start saving money with Flipp? Here\u2019s how!\r\n\r\n<b>Find ads and deals at nearby stores.</b>\r\n- Find deals from Walmart, Walgreens, Dollar General, and more local stores.\r\n- Bonus! Select your favorite stores to quickly access your go-to grocery ads in one spot.\r\n\r\n<b>Search for any item to compare prices at different stores.</b>\r\n- Search for foods like \u201csoda\u201d or \u201cbutter\u201d to see which stores have them on sale.\r\n- Search for any grocery store, like Albertsons, Safeway, or Publix, and quickly find their weekly ad.\r\n\r\n<b>Save weekly ad deals and grocery coupons to your shopping list.</b>\r\n- \u201cClip\u201d or circle deals from weekly ads to your grocery list.\r\n- Tap the plus (+) icon straight from search results to save a deal to your shopping list. \r\n\r\n<b>Create your digital shopping list.</b>\r\n- Add food or other items to your grocery list and Flipp will show you deals for the items on your list. \r\n- Share and combine shopping lists with a friend so that you can both view and add items to it.\r\n\r\n<b>Discover deals by store category.</b>\r\n- Save money on electronics from Best Buy, on pet supplies from Petco and Petsmart, or even on health essentials from Walgreens and Walmart.\r\n- Shop home & garden sales from stores like Home Depot and Lowes. \r\n\r\n<b>Save money every week by comparing prices.</b>\r\n- Discover local stores that are new to you in the \u2018Explore\u2019 page. You might find a new favorite!\r\n- From your shopping list, tap the arrow to compare prices for that item at different stores.\r\n\r\n<b>Get notified when deals drop.</b>\r\n- Don\u2019t see a deal you love right now? Create a Watch List of items to track. \r\n- Flipp will notify you when there are fresh deals for the items on your list.\r\n\r\nSimplify your grocery shopping routine and save money with Flipp\u2019s useful features like the smart shopping list, digital coupons, and weekly ads. Deals from thousands of stores including Walmart, Target, Home Depot, and Albertsons are added weekly \u2014 so don\u2019t miss out! \r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re looking to save money on groceries and other essentials, the Flipp app is a must-have. Questions or suggestions? Contact us at https://help.flipp.com/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Why have several store apps taking up space when Flipp can find you deals from them all? Flipp is the most powerful app for grocery savings and coupons. Simplify your grocery shopping routine and save money on your final bill. Create your grocery list and plan ahead with weekly ads and grocery coupons from thousands of stores \u2014 all in one place!<br><br>Saving money while grocery shopping just got a whole lot easier when you can compare food prices from:<br>- Walmart<br>- Target<br>- Albertsons<br>- Safeway<br>- Publix<br><br>Beyond groceries, Flipp has pharmacy coupons from stores like Walgreens and CVS. And if you love Publix and Family Dollar coupons, you\u2019re in luck because Flipp has them too! <br><br>There\u2019s something for everyone on Flipp \u2014 from tech lovers to pet parents. Find deals from specialty stores including:<br>- Best Buy<br>- Home Depot<br>- Lowes<br>- Petco<br>- Petsmart<br><br>We\u2019re always adding new stores to make saving money on shopping simple!<br><br>Ready to start saving money with Flipp? Here\u2019s how!<br><br><b>Find ads and deals at nearby stores.</b><br>- Find deals from Walmart, Walgreens, Dollar General, and more local stores.<br>- Bonus! Select your favorite stores to quickly access your go-to grocery ads in one spot.<br><br><b>Search for any item to compare prices at different stores.</b><br>- Search for foods like \u201csoda\u201d or \u201cbutter\u201d to see which stores have them on sale.<br>- Search for any grocery store, like Albertsons, Safeway, or Publix, and quickly find their weekly ad.<br><br><b>Save weekly ad deals and grocery coupons to your shopping list.</b><br>- \u201cClip\u201d or circle deals from weekly ads to your grocery list.<br>- Tap the plus (+) icon straight from search results to save a deal to your shopping list. <br><br><b>Create your digital shopping list.</b><br>- Add food or other items to your grocery list and Flipp will show you deals for the items on your list. <br>- Share and combine shopping lists with a friend so that you can both view and add items to it.<br><br><b>Discover deals by store category.</b><br>- Save money on electronics from Best Buy, on pet supplies from Petco and Petsmart, or even on health essentials from Walgreens and Walmart.<br>- Shop home &amp; garden sales from stores like Home Depot and Lowes. <br><br><b>Save money every week by comparing prices.</b><br>- Discover local stores that are new to you in the \u2018Explore\u2019 page. You might find a new favorite!<br>- From your shopping list, tap the arrow to compare prices for that item at different stores.<br><br><b>Get notified when deals drop.</b><br>- Don\u2019t see a deal you love right now? Create a Watch List of items to track. <br>- Flipp will notify you when there are fresh deals for the items on your list.<br><br>Simplify your grocery shopping routine and save money with Flipp\u2019s useful features like the smart shopping list, digital coupons, and weekly ads. Deals from thousands of stores including Walmart, Target, Home Depot, and Albertsons are added weekly \u2014 so don\u2019t miss out! <br><br>If you\u2019re looking to save money on groceries and other essentials, the Flipp app is a must-have. Questions or suggestions? Contact us at https://help.flipp.com/",
